rd=\"true\">who<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">built<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">that<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">service<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">in<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">2021.</span></p><p><span data-word=\"true\">That's<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">not<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">a<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">documentation<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">problem.<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">It's<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">a<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">retrieval<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">problem.<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">And<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">READMEs,<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">Confluence<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">pages,<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">and<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">architecture<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">diagrams<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">don't<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">solve<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">it<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">—<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">they<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">just<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">go<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">stale<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">while<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">the<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">real<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">work<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">keeps<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">moving.</span></p><p><span data-word=\"true\">Xirp<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">is<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">different.<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">It's<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">an<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">agentic<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">development<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">environment<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">that<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">understands<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">your<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">code.<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">Connect<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">it<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">to<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">Portal,<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">and<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">it<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">knows<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">your<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">services,<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">ownership,<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">dependencies,<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">and<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">architectural<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">decisions<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">—<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">all<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">of<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">it,<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">in<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">every<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">session.<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">Your<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">agents<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">don't<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">guess.<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">They<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">know.</span></p></div></DIV>","content_text":"AI coding tools solved the generation problem. Code ships faster, more services get built, output goes up.But something else happened. It took new engineers months to ramp up. AI agents made fast, confident decisions that were technically correct and operationally wrong — because they didn't know what they were actually working inside.The knowledge that would fix this wasn't missing. It was in Slack threads nobody could find, in the heads of the three people who built that service in 2021.That's not a documentation problem. It's a retrieval problem. And READMEs, Confluence pages, and architecture diagrams don't solve it — they just go stale while the real work keeps moving.Xirp is different. It's an agentic development environment that understands your code. Connect it to Portal, and it knows your services, ownership, dependencies, and architectural decisions — all of it, in every session. Your agents don't guess. They know.","fetched_at":"2026-08-11T14:28:59.614Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p><span data-word=\"true\">AI<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">coding<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">tools<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">solved<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">the<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">generation<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">problem.<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">Code<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">ships<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">faster,<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">more<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">services<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">get<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">built,<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">output<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">goes<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">up.</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"AI coding tools solved the generation problem.","zh":"人工智能编码工具解决了生成问题。"},{"en":"Code ships faster, more services get built, output goes up.","zh":"代码交付速度更快，构建更多服务，产出增加。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-word=\"true\">But<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">something<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">else<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">happened.<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">It<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">took<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">new<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">engineers<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">months<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">to<!-- --> </span><span data-word=\"true\">ramp<!-- --> </span><